摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Natural speech synthesis plugin for DeepSeek Harness (TTS, multi-engine, sanitizer)","id":"gh:1340581243","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-tts","slug":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-tts","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","speech","tts","voice"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Natural speech synthesis plugin for DeepSeek Harness (TTS, multi-engine, sanitizer)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 📦 @goodandready/dsh-tts"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Multi-Provider Text-to-Speech Voice Synthesis with Local Neural Engines, Real-time Streaming, IT Dic"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"tionary & Messenger Integration for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🇬🇧 English •\n🇷🇺 Русский •\n🇨🇳 中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"⭐ If you like this plugin, please star it on GitHub — it shows me that the plugin is useful to you a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nd motivates me to keep developing it."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🐛 If you find a bug or would like to request a feature, open a GitHub issue in any language — I will"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" review your proposal and implement useful suggestions in a future plugin version."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## ⚡ Overview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**`dsh-tts`** provides robust, lifelike spoken voice synthesis for assistant replies in the **DeepSe"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ek Harness** Web UI. When **Speak agent replies** is enabled, each finished assistant turn or real-t"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ime streaming chunk is synthesized on the host and streamed directly to the browser."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"API keys never reach client browsers: synthesis is executed entirely on the host backend across **in"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"dependent multi-provider fallback chains**, including local system engines (Edge TTS, Piper, eSpeak)"},{"id":"p9s3","text":". Kokoro-82M and F5-TTS weights can be downloaded for future runtime support, but neural inference i"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"s **not bundled** in this package — those providers fail honestly and the chain continues."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 🚀 Key Features"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 1. 📴 Local and system engines + optional future neural runtimes\n* **Piper / eSpeak**: fully offl"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ine local synthesis without cloud API keys.\n* **Edge TTS**: free online cloud synthesis without API "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"keys (requires network connection and the `edge-tts` CLI).\n* **Kokoro-82M / F5-TTS**: weight downloa"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"d and status UI only. **Neural inference is not bundled** in this package — those providers fail wit"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"h a clear reason and the fallback chain continues. Do not enable them expecting speech until a suppo"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"rted runtime is wired.\n* **ModelManager UI**: Direct manual installation in settings with real-time "},{"id":"p12s7","text":"download progress bar, SHA-256 validation, and deletion. No silent or automatic multi-gigabyte downl"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"oad progress bar, SHA-256 validation, and deletion. No silent or automatic multi-gigabyte downloads."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 2. ⚡ Real-Time Streaming Audio (< 300 ms Latency)\n* **HTML Audio & Web Audio Player**: Seamless "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"queued audio playback with prebuffering, barge-in support, playback rate control, and instant browse"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"r fallback.\n* **Server-Sent Events (SSE)**: Dedicated `/dsh-tts/stream` route delivering synthesized"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" chunks to connected browsers instantly."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 3. 🎙️ Voice Duplex & VAD Barge-In (with `@goodandready/dsh-voice`)\n* **Full-Duplex Conversation*"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"*: Automatic voice reply synthesis upon completion of speech dictation.\n* **VAD Barge-In**: Immediat"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ely mutes assistant speech playback when user voice activity is detected.\n* **Installation Guard**: "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"If `@goodandready/dsh-voice` is not present, settings controls are disabled with an explicit instruc"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"tion banner (`dsh plugin --profile web add @goodandready/dsh-voice`)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 4. 📚 Built-in IT Terminology Pronunciation Dictionary\n* **Pre-configured Lexicon**: Correct phon"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"etic pronunciation for common technical abbreviations and developer terms:\n- `SQL` $\\rightarrow$ \"se"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"quel\"\n- `Nginx` $\\rightarrow$ \"engine-x\"\n- `Kubernetes` / `K8s` $\\rightarrow$ \"coo-ber-net-ees\" / \"k"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ates\"\n- `Docker` $\\rightarrow$ \"docker\", `API` $\\rightarrow$ \"A-P-I\", `JSON` $\\rightarrow$ \"jason\", "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"`YAML` $\\rightarrow$ \"yaml\"\n- `GUI`, `CLI`, `CI/CD`, `PR`, `Regex`, `OAuth`, `HTTP`, `HTTPS`, `CPU`,"},{"id":"p15s6","text":" `GPU`, `RAM`\n* **Interactive UI Editor**: Edit rules, preview phonetic substitutions with the **▶ L"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"isten** button, and populate standard IT terms with one click."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 5. 👥 Multi-Agent Personas & Subagent Voice Overrides\n* Assign distinct voices, providers, models"},{"id":"p16s2","text":", and audio chimes to individual subagents (e.g. `coder`, `reviewer`, `planner`, `tester`).\n* **Suba"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"gent Auto-Detection**: With `autoDetectSubagent` enabled, incoming turns automatically match subagen"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ts by message metadata (`subagent`, `agent`, `author`, `name`) and dynamically apply voice, rate, an"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"d SSML style presets."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 6. 💾 Audio Clip Export & Speech History\n* Export any spoken utterance directly to an audio file "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"(`.wav` / `.mp3`) via `exportAudioClip(text)`.\n* Instant download buttons (`⤓`) integrated directly "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"into the input dock speaker control and recent utterances dropdown list."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 7. 💬 Messenger Voice Notes Integration (with `@goodandready/dsh-messenger-gateway`)\n* Generates "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"voice audio for Telegram and Discord bot replies via `POST /dsh-tts/speak`.\n* Protective dependency "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"check with installation hint when gateway plugin is missing."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 8. 🌐 Canonical English & Chinese Localization (EN + ZH)\n* Complete built-in English (`en`) and C"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"hinese (`zh`) UI and speech template dictionaries.\n* Centralized Russian localization provided via `"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"@goodandready/dsh-russian-lang` through Gitea issue tracking.\n* Smart boundary tokenizer supporting "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"CJK full-width punctuation (`。！？`), abbreviations, file extensions, and IP/version numbers."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 🛠️ Complete Supported Providers Matrix (18 Backends)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Provider Key | Service Backend | Default Model | Default Voice | Credential Ref | Features & Notes"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"Provider Key | Service Backend | Default Model | Default Voice | Credential Ref | Features & Notes |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `kokoro` | Local Kokoro-82M ONNX | `hexgrad/Kokoro-82M` | `af_bella` | *None* | Weights downloadab"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"le; **ONNX inference not bundled** — fails honestly |\n| `f5` | Local F5-TTS GPU Daemon | `F5-TTS` | "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"Default | *None* | Daemon ping only; **GPU inference not bundled** — fails honestly |\n| `elevenlabs`"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" | ElevenLabs API | `eleven_multilingual_v2` | `Rachel` | `ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` | Ultra-realistic, em"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"otional nuance |\n| `openai` | OpenAI Audio | `gpt-4o-mini-tts` / `tts-1` | `alloy` | `OPENAI_API_KEY"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"` | High-quality industry standard |\n| `edge` | Microsoft Edge Online | `en-US-AriaNeural` | `en-US-"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"AriaNeural` | *None* | **Free, high-fidelity neural TTS without API keys** |\n| `siliconflow` | Silic"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"onFlow CosyVoice | `FunAudioLLM/CosyVoice2-0.5B` | Default | `SILICONFLOW_API_KEY` | State-of-the-ar"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"t CosyVoice2 neural engine |\n| `deepinfra` | DeepInfra Kokoro | `hexgrad/Kokoro-82M` | Default | `DE"},{"id":"p22s10","text":"EPINFRA_API_KEY` | Fast open-weights Kokoro synthesis |\n| `fireworks` | Fireworks AI | `kokoro` | De"},{"id":"p22s11","text":"fault | `FIREWORKS_API_KEY` | Ultra-low latency Kokoro inference |\n| `minimax` | MiniMax Speech | `s"},{"id":"p22s12","text":"peech-01-turbo` | Default | `MINIMAX_API_KEY` | High-expressiveness neural voice |\n| `mimo` | Xiaomi"},{"id":"p22s13","text":" MiMo Audio | `mimo-v2.5-tts` | Default | `MIMO_API_KEY` | Low-latency streaming TTS |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
